'''''Polycarpon alsinifolium''''', the '''fourleaf manyseed''', is a species of biennial herb in the family [[Caryophyllaceae]] (carpetweeds).<ref>{{Cite web|title=Polycarpon alsinifolium (Biv.) DC. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/49105268|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Polycarpon alsinifolium (Few-flowered Allseed) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/CRYO/Polycarpon_alsinifolium.php |access-date=2022-03-07 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

